\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Follow these steps to organize your DrawObjs into AGs:\
\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 1. Open AGsInfoFrame (see "Getting Started" above)\
2. Use "Show > All DrawObjs" to see all shapes\
3. Assign each shape to an AG using TemplateWorkFrame\
4. During this phase, shapes can be in multiple AGs (fuzzy logic)\
5. Use "Issues > DrawObjs in Multiple AGs" to see which shapes need reassignment\
6. Use "Issues > DrawObjs with No AG" to find unassigned shapes\
7. Adjust AnchorPattern spreads as needed using the AnchorPattern menu\
